    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_industrial_minerals; processing_state=manufactured; land_basis=mineral): Lime here is burnt lime/plaster (Canadian 'Manufactures: Lime', 'Gypsum Plaster Lime &c'), a building mineral; classifier matched the citrus fruit 'lime'. Layer-1 observations: 57 rows, 1842–1891. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×21; KEW_CUST 4 ×1; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×35. Units: (no unit) ×56; Tons.Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×1. Top routes: Quebec → United States ×7; Quebec → All Countries ×6; Ontario → United States ×3; Nova Scotia → United States ×3."@en ;
